  description: 
  sentences:
    nameNPC: "Binh s\u0129"
    Lines:
    - "Qu\xE2n s\u0129 v\u1ED9i v\xE0ng d\xF9ng khi\xEAn tre, l\xE1 c\xE2y \u01B0\u1EDBt
      che \u0111\u1EA7u. Nh\u01B0ng h\u1ED7n lo\u1EA1n b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u lan."
    - "Ti\u1EBFng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi h\xF2 h\xE9t, ti\u1EBFng ch\xE2n ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
      ch\u1EA1y, ti\u1EBFng g\u01B0\u01A1m gi\xE1o va ch\u1EA1m l\u1EABn l\u1ED9n."
    - "B\u1ED7ng nhi\xEAn\u2014\nR\u1EAEC!\nTi\u1EBFng g\u1ED7 n\u1EE9t v\u1EE1 vang
      l\xEAn r\u1EA5t r\xF5. M\u1ED9t thanh g\u1ED7 ngang b\u1ECB g\xE3y, m\u1ED9t
      g\xF3c c\u1EA7u l\xFAn xu\u1ED1ng."
